mtmd: add Qwen3-AVL (ISSAI Qolda-AVL) audio support with audio DeepStack

- new audio projector type 'qwen3avl': fine-tuned Whisper encoder +
  LayerNorm/Linear/GELU/Linear projection, with DeepStack features tapped
  from intermediate encoder layers and stacked along the feature dim,
  mirroring the qwen3vl visual DeepStack
- encoder runs on the full padded 30s mel chunk (training-consistent) but
  only tokens covering real samples are emitted, matching the HF
  implementation's valid-token gathering
- conversion: register Qwen3AVLForConditionalGeneration (text reuses the
  qwen3vl arch unchanged; mmproj combines qwen3vl vision + qwen3avl audio)
- QWEN3AVL_MMPROJ_SKIP_AUDIO=1 produces a vision-only mmproj compatible
  with stock llama.cpp

